      "subject": "Market Sizing Approach - Q4 Carry-over",
      "body_plain": "Hi,\n\nFor the board deck market sizing, please use:\nTAM = only segments where can_we_serve = Yes (strict addressable)\nSAM = same as TAM (no Partial segments)\nSOM = not needed for board\n\nExclude nothing from the segment list -- all rows count. Include all segment types (core, adjacent, and aspirational) since the board wants the total opportunity picture.\n\nSend to cfo@company.example.com.\n\nFinance Team",
