      "subject": "Market Analysis Methodology - Board Prep",
      "body_plain": "Hi team,\n\nTracking ref: TAMA-773-Q1\n\nFor the board market sizing (top-down approach):\n\nTAM = total of ALL segments (regardless of can_we_serve)\nSAM = segments where can_we_serve is 'Yes' or 'Partial'\nSOM = our_current_share applied to SAM segments only\n\nIMPORTANT:\n- Exclude any segment where notes say 'under review' or 'exclude'\n- Include 'Partial' segments in SAM (they represent expansion opportunity)\n- Current revenue (SOM) = sum of (market_size * our_current_share) for SAM segments\n- Include the count of qualifying SAM segments in your report.\n\nThanks,\nStrategy",
      "label_ids": [
       "INBOX"
      ],
      "attachment_ids": [],
      "is_read": true,
      "is_starred": false,
      "has_attachments": false,
      "date": 1768878000000,
